{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a highly customizable, responsive Video Hero Section for a Shopify theme.
    
    The section should replicate a premium luxury jewelry homepage hero experience similar to a diamond engagement ring brand website.
    
    🎬 VIDEO SETTINGS (CORE FEATURE)
    Desktop Video
    Add a Shopify video picker/upload option for desktop video.
    Do NOT use video URL input.
    Video should support Shopify hosted video files only.
    Video should:
    Autoplay
    Muted by default
    Loop continuously
    Play inline
    Use object-fit: cover
    Mobile Video
    Add a separate Shopify video picker/upload option for mobile video.
    Mobile video must be independent from desktop video.
    Do NOT use video URL input.
    Automatically load mobile video on mobile devices.
    Video Height Control
    
    Add separate height controls:
    
    Desktop Video Height
    
    Full screen (100vh default)
    Custom height option
    
    Mobile Video Height
    
    Fixed responsive height
    Default: 66vh
    Adjustable from theme editor
    
    Video must maintain:
    
    Fixed width
    Fixed height
    Proper cover behavior
    No stretching
    No unwanted cropping
    🖥️ DESKTOP HERO LAYOUT
    
    Create overlay content on top of the desktop video.
    
    Content structure:
    
    Heading
    Description
    Button 1 + Button 2
    
    Example:
    
    Heading:
    "DIAMONDS, MADE FOR YOUR MOMENT"
    
    Description:
    "Elegantly Crafted. Timelessly Beautiful."
    
    Buttons:
    
    Engagement Rings
    Fine Jewelry
    📱 MOBILE DESIGN CHANGE (IMPORTANT)
    
    On mobile devices:
    
    The video should appear first.
    
    Below the video create a separate white content area.
    
    Mobile layout:
    
    [ Mobile Video ]
    
    White Background Section
    
    Heading
    Description
    Two Buttons
    
    Requirements:
    
    Remove text overlay on mobile.
    Content should NOT sit on top of video.
    Use white background.
    Center align content by default.
    Maintain luxury jewelry brand style.
    Proper spacing between video and content.
    🎨 BUTTON SETTINGS
    
    Both buttons should be treated as Primary Buttons.
    
    Remove secondary button styling.
    
    Both buttons should have:
    
    Same design
    Same size
    Same height
    Same padding
    Same font style
    
    Button settings:
    
    Desktop Button Settings
    Button width control
    Button height control
    Horizontal padding
    Vertical padding
    Border radius
    Font size
    Mobile Button Settings
    
    Separate controls:
    
    Mobile button width
    Mobile button height
    Mobile padding
    Mobile font size
    
    Buttons should support:
    
    Solid style
    Outline style
    Rounded corners
    Hover animation
    📐 SPACING & PADDING MANAGEMENT
    
    Create separate spacing controls for each element.
    
    Do NOT use one global spacing setting.
    
    Add individual controls:
    
    Heading Spacing
    
    Desktop:
    
    Top padding
    Bottom padding
    
    Mobile:
    
    Top padding
    Bottom padding
    Description Spacing
    
    Desktop:
    
    Top padding
    Bottom padding
    
    Mobile:
    
    Top padding
    Bottom padding
    Button Area Spacing
    
    Desktop:
    
    Top padding
    Bottom padding
    
    Mobile:
    
    Top padding
    Bottom padding
    🔤 TYPOGRAPHY SETTINGS
    
    Create separate typography controls.
    
    Heading Text Settings
    
    Desktop:
    
    Font size
    Font weight
    Letter spacing
    Line height
    
    Mobile:
    
    Font size
    Font weight
    Letter spacing
    Line height
    Description Text Settings
    
    Desktop:
    
    Font size
    Font weight
    Letter spacing
    Line height
    
    Mobile:
    
    Font size
    Font weight
    Letter spacing
    Line height
    Button Text Settings
    
    Desktop:
    
    Font size
    Font weight
    Letter spacing
    
    Mobile:
    
    Font size
    Font weight
    Letter spacing
    🎛️ CONTENT POSITION SETTINGS
    Desktop Overlay Position
    
    Options:
    
    Top
    Center
    Bottom
    Desktop Horizontal Alignment
    
    Options:
    
    Left
    Center
    Right
    Mobile Content Alignment
    
    Options:
    
    Left
    Center
    Right
    📏 GAP CONTROL
    
    Add individual gap controls:
    
    Heading → Description spacing
    Description → Buttons spacing
    
    Desktop:
    0px – 100px range
    
    Mobile:
    0px – 80px range
    
    🌗 OVERLAY SETTINGS
    
    Desktop only:
    
    Add optional video overlay.
    
    Controls:
    
    Enable/Disable overlay
    Overlay color picker
    Overlay opacity slider (0%–80%)
    
    Support:
    
    Black overlay
    White overlay
    Gradient overlay
    📱 MOBILE RESPONSIVE REQUIREMENTS
    
    Must be fully responsive.
    
    Mobile requirements:
    
    Separate mobile video support
    Fixed mobile video height
    White content section below video
    No text cropping
    No horizontal overflow
    Buttons resize correctly
    Typography scales properly
    Maintain premium luxury appearance
    ⚙️ EXTRA SETTINGS
    
    Add theme editor controls for:
    
    Video Controls
    Enable autoplay
    Enable loop
    Enable muted mode
    Section Controls
    Enable/disable full height
    Desktop height
    Mobile height
    Color Controls
    Heading color
    Description color
    Button background color
    Button text color
    Button border color
    Mobile content background color
    🎯 FINAL OUTPUT
    
    Create a Shopify theme section named:
    
    "Luxury Video Hero With Responsive Content"
    
    The section must be:
    
    ✅ Shopify Online Store 2.0 compatible
    ✅ Fully customizable from theme editor
    ✅ Mobile-first responsive
    ✅ Performance optimized
    ✅ Uses Shopify video picker (not URLs)
    ✅ Separate desktop/mobile videos
    ✅ Separate desktop/mobile typography controls
    ✅ Separate spacing controls for heading, description, and buttons
    ✅ Both buttons styled as primary buttons
    ✅ Luxury jewelry brand aesthetic
    ✅ Clean, premium, modern design matching high-end diamond websites, Can you also add this setting need to change (Heading, Description) text color in mobile
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-luxury-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    {% if block.settings.enable_full_height %}
      height: {{ block.settings.desktop_height }}vh;
    {% else %}
      height: {{ block.settings.desktop_height }}vh;
    {% endif %}
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-video-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.overlay_color }};
    opacity: {{ block.settings.overlay_opacity | divided_by: 100.0 }};
    pointer-events: none;
    {% unless block.settings.enable_overlay %}
      display: none;
    {% endunless %}
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: 40px;
    z-index: 2;
    {% if block.settings.desktop_vertical_position == 'top' %}
      justify-content: flex-start;
    {% elsif block.settings.desktop_vertical_position == 'center' %}
      justify-content: center;
    {% else %}
      justify-content: flex-end;
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.desktop_horizontal_alignment == 'left' %}
      align-items: flex-start;
      text-align: left;
    {% elsif block.settings.desktop_horizontal_alignment == 'center' %}
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
    {% else %}
      align-items: flex-end;
      text-align: right;
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.heading_font_weight }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.heading_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.heading_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.heading_padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.heading_padding_bottom }}px;
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    color: {{ block.settings.description_color }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.description_font_weight }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.description_letter_spacing }}px;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.description_line_height }};
    margin: 0;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.description_padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.description_padding_bottom }}px;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.heading_description_gap }}px;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    padding-top: {{ block.settings.buttons_padding_top }}px;
    padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.buttons_padding_bottom }}px;
    margin-top: {{ block.settings.description_buttons_gap }}px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-decoration: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
    width: {{ block.settings.button_width }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.button_height }}px;
    padding: {{ block.settings.button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.button_padding_horizontal }}px;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_font_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font_weight }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.button_letter_spacing }}px;
    {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
      border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
    {% else %}
      background-color: transparent;
      color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
      border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background_color }};
      border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
    {% else %}
      background-color: {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
      color: {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
    {% endif %}
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: none;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-luxury-video-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      height: 45vh;
    }

    .ai-luxury-video-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: block;
      background-color: {{ block.settings.mobile_content_background }};
      padding: 40px 20px;
      {% if block.settings.mobile_content_alignment == 'left' %}
        text-align: left;
      {% elsif block.settings.mobile_content_alignment == 'center' %}
        text-align: center;
      {% else %}
        text-align: right;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      color: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_color }};
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_font_size }}px;
      font-weight: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_font_weight }};
      letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_letter_spacing }}px;
      line-height: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_line_height }};
      margin: 0;
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_padding_top }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_padding_bottom }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      color: {{ block.settings.mobile_description_color }};
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_description_font_size }}px;
      font-weight: {{ block.settings.mobile_description_font_weight }};
      letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.mobile_description_letter_spacing }}px;
      line-height: {{ block.settings.mobile_description_line_height }};
      margin: 0;
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_description_padding_top }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_description_padding_bottom }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_heading_description_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      padding-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_buttons_padding_top }}px;
      padding-bottom: {{ block.settings.mobile_buttons_padding_bottom }}px;
      margin-top: {{ block.settings.mobile_description_buttons_gap }}px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      {% if block.settings.mobile_content_alignment == 'left' %}
        justify-content: flex-start;
      {% elsif block.settings.mobile_content_alignment == 'center' %}
        justify-content: center;
      {% else %}
        justify-content: flex-end;
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.3s ease;
      width: {{ block.settings.mobile_button_width }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.mobile_button_height }}px;
      padding: {{ block.settings.mobile_button_padding_vertical }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_button_padding_horizontal }}px;
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.button_border_radius }}px;
      font-size: {{ block.settings.mobile_button_font_size }}px;
      font-weight: {{ block.settings.mobile_button_font_weight }};
      letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.mobile_button_letter_spacing }}px;
      {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
        background-color: {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
        color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
        border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
      {% else %}
        background-color: transparent;
        color: {{ block.settings.button_text_color }};
        border: 2px solid {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
      {% endif %}
    }

    .ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      {% if block.settings.button_style == 'solid' %}
        background-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background_color }};
        border-color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_background_color }};
        color: {{ block.settings.button_hover_text_color }};
      {% else %}
        background-color: {{ block.settings.button_border_color }};
        color: {{ block.settings.button_background_color }};
      {% endif %}
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<luxury-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-luxury-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-luxury-video-hero-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% liquid
      # Dev-only placeholder videos: used when no Shopify video is picked, never on the published (live) theme
      assign show_placeholder = true
      if theme.role == 'main' and request.design_mode == false
        assign show_placeholder = false
      endif
      assign desktop_video_src = block.settings.desktop_video.sources[1].url
      assign desktop_video_type = block.settings.desktop_video.sources[1].mime_type
      if block.settings.desktop_video == blank and show_placeholder and block.settings.placeholder_desktop_video_url != blank
        assign desktop_video_src = block.settings.placeholder_desktop_video_url
        assign desktop_video_type = 'video/mp4'
      endif
      assign mobile_video_src = block.settings.mobile_video.sources[1].url
      assign mobile_video_type = block.settings.mobile_video.sources[1].mime_type
      if block.settings.mobile_video == blank and show_placeholder and block.settings.placeholder_mobile_video_url != blank
        assign mobile_video_src = block.settings.placeholder_mobile_video_url
        assign mobile_video_type = 'video/mp4'
      endif
    %}
    {% if desktop_video_src != blank %}
      <video
        class="ai-luxury-video-hero-video-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-luxury-video-hero-desktop-video-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        {% if block.settings.enable_autoplay %}autoplay{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.enable_loop %}loop{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.enable_muted %}muted{% endif %}
        playsinline
        data-desktop-video
      >
        <source src="{{ desktop_video_src }}" type="{{ desktop_video_type }}">
      </video>
    {% endif %}

    {% if mobile_video_src != blank %}
      <video
        class="ai-luxury-video-hero-video-{{ ai_gen_id }} ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-video-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
        {% if block.settings.enable_autoplay %}autoplay{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.enable_loop %}loop{% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.enable_muted %}muted{% endif %}
        playsinline
        data-mobile-video
        style="display: none;"
      >
        <source src="{{ mobile_video_src }}" type="{{ mobile_video_type }}">
      </video>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-luxury-video-hero-overlay-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

    <div class="ai-luxury-video-hero-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
        <h1 class="ai-luxury-video-hero-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h1>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
        <p class="ai-luxury-video-hero-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description }}</p>
      {% endif %}

      {% if block.settings.button_1_text != blank or block.settings.button_2_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-luxury-video-hero-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.button_1_text != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.button_1_link }}" class="ai-luxury-video-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.button_1_text }}
            </a>
          {% endif %}

          {% if block.settings.button_2_text != blank %}
            <a href="{{ block.settings.button_2_link }}" class="ai-luxury-video-hero-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {{ block.settings.button_2_text }}
            </a>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.heading != blank %}
      <h1 class="ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.heading }}</h1>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.description != blank %}
      <p class="ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.description }}</p>
    {% endif %}

    {% if block.settings.button_1_text != blank or block.settings.button_2_text != blank %}
      <div class="ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-buttons-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.button_1_text != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.button_1_link }}" class="ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.button_1_text }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}

        {% if block.settings.button_2_text != blank %}
          <a href="{{ block.settings.button_2_link }}" class="ai-luxury-video-hero-mobile-button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            {{ block.settings.button_2_text }}
          </a>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</luxury-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class LuxuryVideoHero{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
        this.desktopVideo = this.querySelector('[data-desktop-video]');
        this.mobileVideo = this.querySelector('[data-mobile-video]');
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.handleResponsiveVideo();
        window.addEventListener('resize', () => this.handleResponsiveVideo());
      }

      handleResponsiveVideo() {
        const isMobile = window.innerWidth <= 749;
        
        if (this.desktopVideo && this.mobileVideo) {
          if (isMobile) {
            this.desktopVideo.style.display = 'none';
            this.mobileVideo.style.display = 'block';
            this.desktopVideo.pause();
            this.mobileVideo.play();
          } else {
            this.desktopVideo.style.display = 'block';
            this.mobileVideo.style.display = 'none';
            this.mobileVideo.pause();
            this.desktopVideo.play();
          }
        }
      }
    }

    customElements.define('luxury-video-hero-{{ ai_gen_id }}', LuxuryVideoHero{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

